{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神眷顾以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你去向耶路撒冷人的耳中喊叫说，耶和华如此说：",{"text":"你幼年的恩爱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"婚姻的爱情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎样在旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在未曾耕种之地跟随我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都记得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时以色列归耶和华为圣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作为土产初熟的果子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡吞吃它的必算为有罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"灾祸必临到他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列祖先的罪恶"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["雅各家、以色列家的各族啊，你们当听耶和华的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华如此说：",{"text":"你们的列祖见我有什么不义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟远离我，随从虚无的神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己成为虚妄的呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也不说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那领我们从埃及地上来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引导我们经过旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙漠有深坑之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和干旱死荫、无人经过、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人居住之地的耶和华在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我领你们进入肥美之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们得吃其中的果子和美物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你们进入的时候就玷污我的地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的产业成为可憎的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司都不说，耶和华在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传讲律法的都不认识我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"官长违背我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知借巴力说预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"随从无益的神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["神谴责他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：我因此必与你们争辩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必与你们的子孙争辩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们且过到基提海岛去察看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打发人往基达去留心查考，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看曾有这样的事没有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂有一国换了他的神吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实这不是神！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的百姓将他们的荣耀换了那无益的神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诸天哪，要因此惊奇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"极其恐慌，甚为凄凉！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的百姓做了两件恶事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是离弃我这活水的泉源，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为自己凿出池子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是破裂不能存水的池子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列不忠的结局"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"以色列是仆人吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是家中生的奴仆吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为何成为掠物呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少壮狮子向他咆哮，大声吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的地荒凉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑也都焚烧，无人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗人和答比匿人也打破你的头顶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这事临到你身上，不是你自招的吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是因耶和华—你 神引你行路的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你离弃他吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现今你为何在埃及路上要喝西曷的水呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何在亚述路上要喝大河的水呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自己的恶必惩治你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你背道的事必责备你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"由此可知可见，你离弃耶和华—你的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不存敬畏我的心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃为恶事，为苦事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主—万军之耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列拒绝敬拜耶和华"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["我在古时折断你的轭，解开你的绳索。",{"text":"你说：我必不事奉耶和华；","poem":1},"因为你在各高冈上、各青翠树下屈身行淫",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"然而，我栽你是上等的葡萄树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全然是真种子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎么向我变为外邦葡萄树的坏枝子呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你虽用硷、多用肥皂洗濯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你罪孽的痕迹仍然在我面前显出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎能说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有玷污、没有随从众巴力？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你看你谷中的路，就知道你所行的如何。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是快行的独峰驼，狂奔乱走。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是野驴，惯在旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欲心发动就吸风；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起性的时候谁能使它转去呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡寻找它的必不致疲乏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在它的月分必能寻见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说：你不要使脚上无鞋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喉咙干渴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你倒说：这是枉然。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我喜爱别神，我必随从他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列该受惩罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"贼被捉拿，怎样羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家和他们的君王、首领、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司、先知也都照样羞愧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们向木头说：你是我的父；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向石头说：你是生我的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们以背向我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不以面向我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"及至遭遇患难的时候却说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起来拯救我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为自己做的神在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你遭遇患难的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他们起来拯救你吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大啊，你神的数目与你城的数目相等。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为何与我争辩呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都违背了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我责打你们的儿女是徒然的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不受惩治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们自己的刀吞灭你们的先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像残害的狮子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这世代的人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要看明耶和华的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂向以色列作旷野呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或作幽暗之地呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓为何说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们脱离约束，再不归向你了？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"处女岂能忘记她的妆饰呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新妇岂能忘记她的美衣呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓却忘记了我无数的日子！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"text":"你怎么修饰你的道路要求爱情呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是恶劣的妇人你也叫她们行你的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且你的衣襟上有无辜穷人的血；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你杀他们并不是遇见他们挖窟窿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是因这一切的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你还说：我无辜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的怒气必定向我消了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我必审问你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你自说：我没有犯罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何东跑西奔要更换你的路呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因埃及蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像从前因亚述蒙羞一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也必两手抱头从埃及出来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华已经弃绝你所倚靠的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不因他们得顺利。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或译：我在古时折断你的轭，解开你的绳索，你就说：我必不事奉别神。谁知你在各高冈上、各青翠树下仍屈身行淫","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":37}